abstract: >-
  UDCDGA_Generator is an open-source Python framework for the reproducible
  construction of datasets for Domain Generation Algorithm (DGA) research.
  The software implements a modular three-stage workflow comprising
  benign-domain aggregation, DGA-generated domain generation, and balanced
  dataset construction with feature extraction. The framework supports
  configurable and deterministic dataset generation, domain normalization
  and validation, duplicate and cross-class overlap removal, persistent
  deduplication, execution statistics, integrity validation, and
  reproducibility metadata. The final dataset construction stage computes
  a predefined set of 54 lexical, structural, statistical, and n-gram-based
  features and exports the resulting data primarily in Apache Parquet format.
